              "ImageDescription": {
                "value": "Morris Isis 1930 model used during Amy Johnson's visit to Brisbane, 1930.\nFully imported, British, Morris Isis sedan. Vehicle had 6 cylinders and hydralic brakes. This photograph of the sedan, Johnnie, was taken turning out of Government House into Fernberg Road. Amy Johnson is seated in the back of the car and not visible. The driver is Janet Burge?. The car had no registration numbers, only the letters JOHNNIE attached on the front and the back of the car. The colour of the car was cream with green trim. (Description supplied with the photograph.).",
